<title>ITALY: Technical problems delay Milan bourse futures open.</title>
<headline>Technical problems delay Milan bourse futures open.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The opening of futures and options trade on the Milan stock exchange was delayed due to technical problems, the bourse data processing centre Cedborsa, said.</p>
<p>Further information will be given as soon as possible.</p>
</text>
